# Technology Stack

We'll use tools that are beginner-friendly while also teaching industry-relevant skills.

| Component        | Technology             | Why We Need It                    |
|---               |---                     |---                                |
| Programming      | Python 3               | Main programming language         |
| Backend          | Flask                  | Handles application logic         |
| Frontend         | HTML, CSS, JavaScript  | Builds the website                |
| Database         | SQLite                 | Stores user reports               |
| Database access  | SQLAlchemy             | Connects Python to the database   |
| Data processing  | Pandas                 | Processes datasets                |
| Machine learning | Scikit-learn           | Builds the detection model        |
| Visualization    | Chart.js               | Displays analytics                |
| Version control  | Git + GitHub           | Tracks development                |
| Deployment       | Render                 | Publishes the application         |